I don't think the question is sufficiently clear, but my best guess is
that you're looking for something like this:

library(reshape2)
dat <- data.frame(
    dat[-1],
    colsplit(
        dat$month,
        pattern = "-",
        names = c("year", "month"))
    )

ggplot(dat,
       aes(x = month,
           y = amount,
           color = factor(year))) +
    geom_line()

Best,
Ista

